#
# addRange(10,20): ranges=[(10,20)]. removeRange(14,16): → [(10,14),(16,20)].
# queryRange(10,14)→True ✓. queryRange(13,15)→False (gap at 14-16) ✓
#
# "No bugs. Remove splits intervals; Add merges overlapping ones."
